                                                "sense_id": "7f770b3d-bb3c-3273-85ca-15ca4dc4ee42",
                                                "text": "1523-1525, John Bourchier, 2nd Baron Berners, Froissart's Chronicles\nall great rivers are gorged and assembled of various surges and springs of water"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
